<h2>Eventbrite sync failed</h2>
<p>The scheduled Eventbrite ticket sync did not complete successfully.</p>
<ul>
  {% if event_slug %}<li><strong>Event:</strong> {{ event_slug }}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if reason %}<li><strong>Reason:</strong> {{ reason }}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if attempted_at %}<li><strong>Attempted at:</strong> {{ attempted_at }}</li>{% endif %}
</ul>
<p>
  Ticket data may be stale until the next successful sync. Check the
  dashboard's sync status, and the application logs for the underlying error.
</p>
